1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:02,780
A zombie ran toward my farmhouse.

2
00:00:02,850 --> 00:00:04,190
Not to attack me.

3
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:05,160
To hide.

4
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,340
Behind it, the cornfield was bending in a straight line.

5
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:11,380
But the trees weren't moving.

6
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:15,630
Then a glass on my table started shaking.

7
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:21,940
Here's what we know:
vibrations can travel through soil and into nearby buildings.

8
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:25,290
But shaking alone can't tell you the cause.

9
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:27,430
I checked the tractor.

10
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:29,060
Engine off.

11
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:33,150
Outside, the fence posts rattled one after another.

12
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:36,560
Whatever was moving, it was heading toward the barn.

13
00:00:37,400 --> 00:00:38,860
Then I saw it.

14
00:00:39,300 --> 00:00:40,950
The old maintenance hatch.

15
00:00:41,600 --> 00:00:43,950
Its rusted handle began turning.

16
00:00:44,600 --> 00:00:46,050
From underneath.

17
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:52,110
My radio crackled for the first time all morning.

18
00:00:52,600 --> 00:00:54,080
A voice whispered...

19
00:00:54,900 --> 00:00:56,460
(radio, whispering) Don't let it out.

